a at King Spa Virginia","sizes":"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px"},"link":null}}],"wrapCls":"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated"}],"containerCls":"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default","pre":"<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"elementor-shape elementor-shape-bottom\" data-negative=\"false\">\n<svg preserveaspectratio=\"none\" viewbox=\"0 0 1000 100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path class=\"elementor-shape-fill\" d=\"M1000,4.3V0H0v4.3C0.9,23.1,126.7,99.2,500,100S1000,22.7,1000,4.3z\"></path>\n</svg> </div>"},{"_type":"section","_key":"12cfb5f0","tag":"section","cls":"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-12cfb5f0 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default","attrs":{"data-id":"12cfb5f0","data-element_type":"section","data-e-type":"section"},"columns":[{"_type":"column","_key":"265e2086","cls":"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-265e2086","attrs":{"data-id":"265e2086","data-element_type":"column","data-e-type":"column"},"children":[{"_type":"widget","_key":"2d92e761","wtype":"heading.default","cls":"elementor-element elementor-element-2d92e761 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading","attrs":{"data-id":"2d92e761","data-element_type":"widget","data-e-type":"widget","data-widget_type":"heading.default"},"heading":{"tag":"h2","cls":"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default","attrs":{},"html":"Nourish Yourself in King Spa's Dining Hall"}},{"_type":"widget","_key":"405aa752","wtype":"text-editor.default","cls":"elementor-element elementor-element-405aa752 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor","attrs":{"data-id":"405aa752","data-element_type":"widget","data-e-type":"widget","data-widget_type":"text-editor.default"},"text":"<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">When our guests visit King Spa, our goal is to make them feel like they can spend the entire day with us without having to leave. That’s why we’ve made our Korean day spa and sauna your complete destination for whole-body and mind rejuvenation, and our spa restaurant and dining hall is no exception. We serve the most nourishing food and beverage options to help your body recover from all the detoxing you’ll be doing in our saunas, steam rooms, therapy rooms, massage rooms, hydrotherapy pools, and more. It takes a lot of energy for your body to detox, so you’ll definitely be hungry after spending the day with us. Make sure you add nourishment back to your body by visiting our dining hall and indulging in something delicious!</p>"},{"_type":"section","_key":"19cabe94","tag":"section","cls":"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-19cabe94 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default","attrs":{"data-id":"19cabe94","data-element_type":"section","data-e-type":"section"},"columns":[{"_type":"column","_key":"4c4e5379","cls":"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-4c4e5379","attrs":{"data-id":"4c4e5379","data-element_type":"column","data-e-type":"column"},"children":[{"_type":"widget","_key":"2c0be042","wtype":"image.default","cls":"elementor-element elementor-element-2c0be042 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image","attrs":{"data-id":"2c0be042","data-element_type":"widget","data-e-type":"widget","data-widget_type":"image.default"},"image":{"img":{"loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","width":"1024","height":"683","src":"/images/wp/2023/01/dining-restaurant-1-1.jpg","class":"attachment-large size-large wp-image-12115","alt":"restaurant","sizes":"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px"},"link":null}}],"wrapCls":"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated"},{"_type":"column","_key":"73c6f7b9","cls":"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-73c6f7b9","attrs":{"data-id":"73c6f7b9","data-element_type":"column","data-e-typ