ta-element_type":"widget","data-e-type":"widget","data-widget_type":"text-editor.default"},"text":"<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">It’s vital to stay thoroughly hydrated while visiting King Spa, especially if you are spending time in our saunas and hot tubs because the body can become quickly dehydrated when it’s sweating. That’s why we offer a large variety of delicious beverage options to quench your thirst and keep you hydrated all day long, including our homemade smoothies and juices like aloe vera juice, ginger juice, and our Korean sweet rice drink (<em>sikhye</em>). We also offer hot teas, sodas, water, energy drinks, sports beverages, Starbucks coffee, and so much more! You can even enjoy a refreshing beverage while lounging in our outdoor bade pool (open all-year long).</p>"},{"_type":"section","_key":"3e27f856","tag":"section","cls":"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-3e27f856 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default","attrs":{"data-id":"3e27f856","data-element_type":"section","data-e-type":"section"},"columns":[{"_type":"column","_key":"434eadc7","cls":"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-434eadc7","attrs":{"data-id":"434eadc7","data-element_type":"column","data-e-type":"column"},"children":[{"_type":"widget","_key":"598d7927","wtype":"image.default","cls":"elementor-element elementor-element-598d7927 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image","attrs":{"data-id":"598d7927","data-element_type":"widget","data-e-type":"widget","data-widget_type":"image.default"},"image":{"img":{"loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","width":"1024","height":"683","src":"/images/wp/2023/01/sikhye-korean-rice-drink-2.jpeg","class":"attachment-large size-large wp-image-12132","alt":"Sikhye Korean Rice Drink","sizes":"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px"},"link":null}}],"wrapCls":"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated"},{"_type":"co