ata-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">If you plan to spend a few hours or more at King Spa, you’re definitely going to get hungry. And we’ve got you covered! You may want to enjoy a small snack or two in between getting your spa treatments and visiting the pools, spas, or saunas. We offer many options for snacking, such as appetizers like chicken wings, french fries, pot stickers, corn dogs, and our famous sauna-cooked eggs at our spa restaurant. Get a snack while you wait for your massage or facial appointment!</p>"},{"_type":"section","_key":"509f922c","tag":"section","cls":"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-509f922c elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default","attrs":{"data-id":"509f922c","data-element_type":"section","data-e-type":"section"},"columns":[{"_type":"column","_key":"4e99d99d","cls":"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-4e99d99d","attrs":{"data-id":"4e99d99d","data-element_type":"column","data-e-type":"column"},"children":[{"_type":"widget","_key":"5b8d0804","wtype":"image.default","cls":"elementor-element elementor-element-5b8d0804 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image","attrs":{"data-id":"5b8d0804","data-element_type":"widget","data-e-type":"widget","data-widget_type":"image.default"},"image":{"img":{"loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","width":"1024","height":"683","src":"/images/wp/2024/10/snack-image.webp","class":"attachment-large size-large wp-image-17623","alt":"snacks","sizes":"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px"},"link":null}}],"wrapCls":"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated"},{"_type":"column","_key":"54c4e398","cls":"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-54c4e398","attrs":{"data-id":"54c4e398","data-element_type":"column","data-e-type":"column"},"children":[],"wrapCls":"elementor-widget-wrap"},{"_type":"column","_key":"342dfba9","cls":"elemen