cluding our spectacular Korean food options like bibimbap. Or you can always stick to traditional American foods like hot dogs and burgers. And if you’re looking for something simple and healthy, we have delicious salad and soup options too. We have it all at King Spa! Just visit our spa restaurant anytime!</p>"},{"_type":"section","_key":"5ef1a5a","tag":"section","cls":"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-5ef1a5a elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default","attrs":{"data-id":"5ef1a5a","data-element_type":"section","data-e-type":"section"},"columns":[{"_type":"column","_key":"1197beb0","cls":"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-1197beb0","attrs":{"data-id":"1197beb0","data-element_type":"column","data-e-type":"column"},"children":[{"_type":"widget","_key":"283e65e5","wtype":"image.default","cls":"elementor-element elementor-element-283e65e5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image","attrs":{"data-id":"283e65e5","data-element_type":"widget","data-e-type":"widget","data-widget_type":"image.default"},"image":{"img":{"loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","width":"1024","height":"683","src":"/images/wp/2025/07/DSC_0600-2-opt.webp","class":"attachment-large size-large wp-image-19702","alt":"","sizes":"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px"},"link":null}}],"wrapCls":"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated"},{"_type":"column","_key":"50a1fa4c","cls":"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-50a1fa4c","attrs":{"data-id":"50a1fa4c","data-element_type":"column","data-e-type":"column"},"children":[],"wrapCls":"elementor-widget-wrap"},{"_type":"column","_key":"3abe8ff0","cls":"elementor-column elementor-col-33 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-3abe8ff0","attrs":{"data-id":"3abe8ff0","data-element_type":"column","data-e-type":"column"},"children":[],"wrapCls":"elementor-widget-wrap"}],"containerCls":"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default"}],"wrapCls":"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated"}],"containerCls":"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default"},{"_type":"section","_key":"3eeffdb7","tag":"section","cls":"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-3eeffdb7 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default","attrs":{"data-id":"3eeffdb7","data-element_type":"section","data-e-type":"section"},"columns":[{"_type":"column","_key":"5e63e2dd","cls":"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-5e63e2dd","attrs":{"data-id":"5e63e2dd","data-element_type":"column","data-e-type":"column"},"children":[{"_type":"widget","_key":"237ed95e","wtype":"heading.default","cls":"elementor-element elementor-element-237ed95e elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading","attrs":{"data-id":"237ed95e","data-element_type":"widget","data-e-type":"widget","data-widget_type":"heading.default"},"heading":{"tag":"h2","cls":"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default","attrs":{},"html":"Our Dining Hall Hours"}},{"_type":"widget","_key":"1580ab11","wtype":"text-editor.default","cls":"elementor-element elementor-element-1580ab11 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor","attrs":{"data-id":"1580ab11","data-element_type":"widget","data-e-type":"widget","data-widget_type":"text-editor.default"},"text":"<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Our spa restaurant and dining hall is open morning and night to provide you with a delicious culinary experience. You can be sure that you’ll be fully nourished and satisfied as you spend the day detoxing, relaxing, and rejuvenating with us while indulging in our <a href=\"/explore/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Korean spa amenities</a> like our saunas, pools, <a href=\"/massage-therapy/\">therapy rooms</a>, hot tubs, steam rooms, and <a href=\"/korean-bath-spa/\">bathhouse</a>, and while enjoying the many <a href=\"/treatments/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Korean spa services</a> we have to offer, such as our massages, <a href=\"/body-scrub-2/\">Korean body scrub</a>, and facials.</p><p><u>Dining Hall Hours of Operation:</u></p><p>Daily: 10:00 am – 10:00 pm</p>"}],"wrapCls":"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated"}],"containerCls":"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default"},{"_type":"section","_key":"2888603f","tag":"section","cls":"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-2888603f elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default","attrs":{"data-id":"2888603f","data-element_type":"section","data-e-type":"section"},"columns":[{"_type":"column","_key":"2f65b5de","cls":"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-2f65b5de","attrs":{"data-id":"2f65b5de","data-element_type":"column","data-e-type":"column"},"children":[{"_type":"widget","_key":"3843de6b","wtype":"heading.default","cls":"elementor-element elementor-element-3843de6b elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading","attrs":{"data-id":"3843de6b","data-element_type":"widget","data-e-type":"widget","data-widget_type":"heading.default"},"heading":{"tag":"h2","cls":"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default","attrs":{},"html":"Come visit us today!"}},{"_type":"widget","_key":"66939ac","wtype":"text-editor.default","cls":"elementor-element elementor-element-66939ac elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor","attrs":{"data-id":"66939ac","data-element_type":"widget","data-e-type":"widget","data-widget_type":"text-editor.default"},"text":"<p data-pm-slice=\"1 1 []\">Need a reason to visit King Spa besides just getting the opportunity to visit our delicious Korean spa restaurant? Check out these amazing <a href=\"https://store.kingspa.com/virginia/packages.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">spa packages</a> and massage services we offer and treat yourself and maybe a special someone to a luxurious day at the spa. Or come in with your friends and family to enjoy our all-season outdoor bade pool and hot tubs while also enjoying the countless saunas we have to offer. At <a href=\"/\">King Spa</a> we have something for everyone. As we like to say, all are welcome to come here to <em>heal</em> and <em>feel</em>.</p><p>Buy your <a href=\"/day-pass/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Day Pass</a> online now and come enjoy your favorite Korean spa in Northern Virginia 365 days a year! Our <a href=\"/saunas-therapy-rooms/\">Korean sauna</a>, spa, and bathhouse are waiting for you.</p><p>Call us at <a href=\"tel:7039573010\">(703) 957-3010</a> or visit us at 25330 Eastern Marketplace Plaza, Chantilly, VA 20152.</p>"},{"_type":"section","_key":"387aaf79","tag":"section","cls":"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-387aaf79 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default","attrs":{"data-id":"387aaf79","data-element_type":"section","data-e-type":"section"},"columns":[{"_type":"column","_key":"1de6d640","cls":"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-1de6d640","attrs":{"data-id":"1de6d640","data-element_type":"column","data-e-type":"column"},"children":[{"_type":"widget","_key":"349b79ff","wtype":"button.default","cls":"elementor-element elementor-element-349b79ff elementor-align-center elementor-widget__width-auto elementor-widget-mobile__width-inherit elementor-widget elementor-widget-button","attrs":{"data-id":"349b79ff","data-element_type":"widget","data-e-type":"widget","data-widget_type":"button.default"},"html":"<div class=\"elementor-button-wrapper\">\n<a class=\"elementor-button elementor-button-link elementor-size-lg\" href=\"/day-pass/\">\n<span class=\"elementor-button-content-wrapper\">\n<span class=\"el